     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\">Hello, </font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\">I am trying to build a phylogenetic tree of ~1000 nodes with msa, phangorn and ggtree packages. </font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\">I aligned my sequences with msa:msaMuscle(), then run some phangorn package code get optim.pml fit object and then plot it with ggtree. At the line:</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">phangorn </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> treeio</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">phyPML</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ml&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div></code></div><br></span><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">I get an error saying:</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">phangorn </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> treeio</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">phyPML</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tmp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ml&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> getSubsLabel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fasta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">parent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> translate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> removeGap</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  seqA should have equal length to seqB<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> addition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Warning</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> messages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FUN</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">newX</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ambiguous found</span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FUN</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">newX</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ambiguous found</span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span></div></code></div><div><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\">I also tried with ggtree::phyPML() or just phyPML() functions. Any reason why is this not working? Code and sessionInfo are added below</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font></div></div><div><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\" face=\"monospace\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><div style=\"text-align:left\">library(phangorn)<br>library(msa)<br>library(ggtree)    <br><br>fastaAligned62 &lt;- msa::msaMuscle(fastaRefined62, verbose=TRUE) </div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align:left\">uniprot.refined &lt;- as.phyDat(fastaAligned62)</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">rm(fastaAligned62)</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">   </div><div style=\"text-align:left\">names(uniprot.refined) &lt;- homologySummary62[1:length(uniprot.refined),]$SequenceFullName</div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align:left\">dm &lt;- <a href=\"http://dist.ml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dist.ml&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482232550000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2BmbM30CCBzkqogq2GCzzI\">dist.ml</a>(uniprot.refined, model=&quot;JTT&quot;)</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">tree &lt;- NJ(dm)</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">    </div><div style=\"text-align:left\">cat(&#39;Testing all models ...\\n&#39;)</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">(mt &lt;- modelTest(uniprot.refined, model=&quot;all&quot;, multicore=TRUE))</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">env &lt;- attr(mt, &quot;env&quot;)</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">fitStart &lt;- eval(get(mt$Model[which.min(mt$BIC)], env), env)</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">fitNJ &lt;- pml(tree, uniprot.refined, model=fitStart$model, k=4, inv=.2)</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">fit &lt;- optim.pml(fitNJ, rearrangement = &quot;stochastic&quot;,</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">                     optInv=TRUE, optGamma=TRUE)</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">fit</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">phangorn &lt;- treeio::phyPML(fit, type=&quot;ml&quot;)<br></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align:left\">tiff(&quot;HomologyTree.tiff&quot;, width = 6400, height = 6400, units = &quot;px&quot;, res = 800)</div><div style=\"text-align:left\"> </div><div style=\"text-align:left\">ggtree(phangorn) + geom_text(aes(x=branch, label=AA_subs, vjust=-.5))</div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br></div><div><div style=\"text-align:left\">dev.off()</div></div><div><br></div></div></code></div><br></font></div><br><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><div><font color=\"#660066\">&gt; sessionInfo()</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">R version 3.4.4 (2018-03-15)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">Platform: x86_64-pc-linux-gnu (64-bit)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">Running under: Ubuntu 18.04.2 LTS</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">Matrix products: default</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">BLAS: /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/blas/libblas.so.3.7.1</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">LAPACK: /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/lapack/liblapack.so.3.7.1</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">locale:</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"> [1] LC_CTYPE=en_US.UTF-8       LC_NUMERIC=C</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"> [3] LC_TIME=en_US.UTF-8        LC_COLLATE=en_US.UTF-8</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"> [5] LC_MONETARY=en_US.UTF-8    LC_MESSAGES=en_US.UTF-8</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"> [7] LC_PAPER=en_US.UTF-8       LC_NAME=C</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"> [9] LC_ADDRESS=C               LC_TELEPHONE=C</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">[11] LC_MEASUREMENT=en_US.UTF-8 LC_IDENTIFICATION=C</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">attached base packages:</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">[1] stats4    parallel  stats     graphics  grDevices utils     datasets</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">[8] methods   base</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">other attached packages:</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"> [1] phangorn_2.5.3      ape_5.3             msa_1.10.0</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"> [4] Biostrings_2.46.0   XVector_0.18.0      IRanges_2.12.0</font></